Z||000013||fiero56||11-11-2000||10:00 PM||||I see the "Wall of Shame" is still going. There is some scary $hit on there. I got see the broken rotor taken off a Fiero and placed on the wall. What a day, can't wait to go back down there. The connecting rods in the oil pan are the scariest though. One is twisted all the way around.<P>Looks different than when I was down. More Fieros, and what is rain doing in 'bama?!||||reg||1
